      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name} A lot of people tend to forget that people in poverty can have access to the internet and can have hobbies. I'm not in the best financial situation personally, so any subscription is off the table, nontheless a subscription I only play once in a while to spend time with long-distance friends.\n\nAge-verification is a safety feature and shouldn't even be paywalled to start with.",
