  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'm begging you to add the age verification for people who dont have VRC+ because (like me) a lot of people cant afford it and now i'm just stuck alone in some worlds cause i cant join my friends who are only in 18+ session. Of course i'm 18+ or i wouldn't be asking for this.",
